/-!
# CA-F: the actual contour potential on the negative frequency axis

`ConfigContourFormula.contourReferencePotential_neg` evaluates the literal
Fejer contour potential at `-t` (`t >= 1/2`) as the checker formula
`nu_out(t)`.  This file gives a computable rational upper bound `nuHi t`
for that value (square root, logarithm, and the 48 Fejer moments are all
enclosed) and proves that `t ↦ contourReferencePotential (-t)` is monotone
on `[1/2, ∞)`, from the proved derivative under the original integral.
-/

